OL,3,GNEWSARunning can be good for
OL,4,Aosteoarthritis, says study
OL,5,
OL,6,FRunners with osteoarthritis should not
OL,7,Fbe routinely discouraged from
OL,8,Fhigh-impact exercise, a study suggests.
OL,10,FResearchers from the University of
OL,11,FEssex analysed data from 17,661
OL,12,Fpatients with knee or hip
OL,13,Fosteoarthritis.
OL,15,FIt found patients who did high-impact
OL,16,Factivities like running or tennis were
OL,17,F36% to 48% less likely to need a total
OL,18,Fhip replacement over the course of 12
OL,19,Fmonths. These patients were no more
OL,20,Flikely to need knee replacements, they
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
